{
  "_comment": [
    "Hand-curated display name -> domain, for scripts/fetch-merchant-icons.js.",
    "Keys are the merchant's DISPLAY NAME exactly as merchantDisplayFor() returns it.",
    "",
    "Two reasons an entry lives here:",
    "  1. The guesser cannot reach the domain. 'Whole Foods' guesses wholefoods.com;",
    "     the brand is at wholefoodsmarket.com. Nothing derives that.",
    "  2. The site refuses to serve us its homepage (Akamai/Cloudflare bot walls),",
    "     so there is no title to verify against. An override is trusted without",
    "     verification, and the blind /favicon.ico paths still find the icon.",
    "",
    "A null value means 'looked, no usable official site' — it stops the guesser",
    "from re-trying a brand every run, and stops a plausible-looking wrong domain",
    "from being picked up later. An unlisted brand is simply guessed and verified.",
    "",
    "This key is ignored by the loader (no merchant is called '_comment')."
  ],
